{"t":"032830.KS","n":"Samsung Life Insurance Co., Ltd.","nKo":"삼성생명보험","ex":"KSE","cur":"KRW","px":247000.0,"chg":22000.0,"chgPct":0.09778,"prev":225000.0,"dayH":249000.0,"dayL":237500.0,"w52H":516500.0,"w52L":144500.0,"vol":270555,"avgVol":253263,"mcap":44354970320896,"pe":null,"fpe":8.62,"eps":null,"feps":null,"pb":null,"div":5300.0,"divY":0.0236,"beta":1.06,"short":null,"shortPct":null,"shortRatio":null,"prof":{"c":"South Korea","cKo":"대한민국","s":"Financial Services","sKo":"금융 서비스","i":"Insurance - Life","iKo":"보험 - 생명","city":"Seoul","emp":4675,"web":"https://www.samsunglife.com","sum":"Samsung Life Insurance Co., Ltd., together with its subsidiaries, engages in the life insurance business to corporate and individual customers in South Korea and internationally. The company operates through Domestic Insurance; Credit Card Service, Installment Financing and Leasing; and Overseas segments. It also offers various loan products for companies, household, and stocks and bonds, as well as mortgage loans; and retirement pension, funds, and asset management services. The company was formerly known as Dongbang Life Insurance and changed its name to Samsung Life Insurance Co., Ltd. in July 1989. Samsung Life Insurance Co., Ltd. was founded in 1957 and is headquartered in Seoul, South Korea.","sumKo":"삼성생명보험주식회사는 자회사와 함께 한국 및 해외의 기업 및 개인 고객을 대상으로 생명보험 사업을 영위하고 있습니다. 회사는 국내 보험을 통해 운영됩니다. 신용카드 서비스, 할부금융 및 리스; 및 해외 부문. 또한 기업, 가계, 주식 및 채권을 위한 다양한 대출 상품은 물론 주택담보대출도 제공합니다. 퇴직연금, 펀드, 자산관리 서비스 등을 제공하고 있습니다. 이 회사는 이전에 동방생명보험으로 알려져 있었고 1989년 7월에 삼성생명보험주식회사로 사명을 변경했습니다. 삼성생명보험주식회사는 1957년에 설립되었으며 대한민국 서울에 본사를 두고 있습니다."},"fin":{"annual":[{"y":2022,"rev":19259534000000,"ni":616696000000},{"y":2023,"rev":0,"ni":1382902000000},{"y":2024,"rev":0,"ni":1486936000000},{"y":2025,"rev":0,"ni":1699762000000}],"quarterly":[{"q":"4Q2025","rev":0,"ni":89868000000},{"q":"1Q2026","rev":0,"ni":1203581000000},{"q":"2Q2026","rev":0,"ni":689921000000},{"q":"3Q2026","rev":0,"ni":792351000000}],"eps":[{"q":"